# Loaded automatically by `vite build` (production). Same-origin default:
# the Cloudflare Worker serves both the built SPA and the /api/* routes from
# one deployment (see worker/wrangler.jsonc's `assets` binding), so a
# relative path is correct and never resolves to localhost.
#
# If the frontend and the Worker are ever deployed on separate domains,
# override this with the real Worker URL via your hosting platform's
# environment-variable settings (e.g. Vercel project settings) — do NOT
# hardcode a production domain in source:
#   VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://ACTUAL-PRODUCTION-WORKER-DOMAIN/api
VITE_API_BASE_URL=/api
